# Every text file is checked out with LF on every system (Git on Windows would otherwise write CRLF, and the
# tests compare bytes and sizes). Git still detects binary files by itself; the known kinds are named as well.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
bin/agentgraph text eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
desktop-plugin/gui-experimental.cjs text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
